    """ar",["9999","MK","02"],"Iranshahr","Tajikistan","`NNNN LL NN` — serial, letters, region — with the flag block at the hoist end. `TT` turns it amber (public transport).","AzerbaijanThemes.civilian"],["tj.carTwoRow","Private car (two-row)","tj.carTwoRow",["9999","MK","02"],"Iranshahr","Tajikistan","The same eight characters and groups, broken across two rows for a vehicle with no room for a 520 mm plate.","AzerbaijanThemes.civilian"],["tj.motorcycle","Motorcycle","tj.motorcycle",["304","A","03"],"Iranshahr","Tajikistan","A three-digit serial over one letter and the region.","AzerbaijanThemes.civilian"],["tj.trailer","Trailer","tj.trailer",["07","AA","0776"],"Iranshahr","Tajikistan","The one two-row plate that leads with its region: `NN LL` up top, the four-digit serial to itself below.","AzerbaijanThemes.civilian"],["tj.police","Police","tj.police",["0245","M","01"],"Iranshahr","Tajikistan","White on blue, `TJ` reversed out white, one letter between serial and region.","TajikistanThemes.police"],["tj.foreign","Foreign vehicle","tj.foreign",["200","P","005"],"Iranshahr","Tajikistan","Black on yellow, no flag: a foreign vehicle carries no region, so the hoist end is bare and the number is `NNN L NNN`.","TajikistanThemes.foreign"],["tj.diplomatic","Diplomatic corps","tj.diplomatic",["091","CMD","1"],"Iranshahr","Tajikistan","White on red, no flag: a serial, a class code — `CD`, `CMD`, `D`, `T` or `S` chosen as one glyph group — and a trailing digit.","TajikistanThemes.diplomatic"],["tj.governmental","Governmental","tj.governmental",["001","CO","04"],"Iranshahr","Tajikistan","The old Russian-derived layout: serial, two letters, then the region boxed off by a divider with `RT` beneath it.","TajikistanThemes.governmental"],["kw.civilian","Civilian private vehicle","kw.civilian",["12","45678"],"Iranshahr","Kuwait","Standard private vehicle: black text on white field with flag block. Codes 1-89.","KuwaitThemes.civilian"],["kw.transport","Public transport","kw.transport